      "avatar_template": "/letter_avatar_proxy/v4/letter/d/a9adbd/{size}.png",
      "created_at": "2022-03-03T21:41:06.574Z",
      "cooked": "<p>Yeah, the situation in brief.</p>\n<p>GtG acquire the full rights to Cheapass Games in 2019.</p>\n<p>They celebrate by taking down the original site (and a large number of Print &amp; Play files) and making the URL redirect to them.</p>\n<p>They tell us to stay tuned for an update and then radio silence for three years…</p>",
