      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/jeysie/{size}/1868_2.png",
      "created_at": "2022-03-06T12:53:47.462Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I do agree it’s disappointing that they haven’t updated the site with the Print and Play files, especially considering there’s been a number of downloads for other GTG IPs that also got removed in the site upgrade and never restored.</p>\n<p>Supply issues are the reason that physical updates have been thin on the ground, as liarliar noted, but I don’t see a good reason for not restoring the old digital downloads IMHO.</p>",
